    "detailed_description": "You are a sewer maintenance worker for a prestigious company and have been tasked to explore a horrifying network of tunnels that have been closed off due to mysterious disappearances of workers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871970/extras/2906a73169926f594fb2d403cd06d460.poster.avif?t=1711157148\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871970/extras/2906a73169926f594fb2d403cd06d460.webm?t=1711157148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871970/extras/2906a73169926f594fb2d403cd06d460.mp4?t=1711157148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You must be prepared to fend off anything that comes your way, with or without company. You will need to fix machinery, solve puzzles and power generators to unlock clues for the investigation of the recent disappearances. Do not explore alone, as many have already gone missing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871970/extras/bd5335b26b7f47141befba0c03d8b887.poster.avif?t=1711157148\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871970/extras/bd5335b26b7f47141befba0c03d8b887.webm?t=1711157148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871970/extras/bd5335b26b7f47141befba0c03d8b887.mp4?t=1711157148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "You are a sewer maintenance worker for a prestigious company and have been tasked to explore a horrifying network of tunnels that have been closed off due to mysterious disappearances of workers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871970/extras/2906a73169926f594fb2d403cd06d460.poster.avif?t=1711157148\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871970/extras/2906a73169926f594fb2d403cd06d460.webm?t=1711157148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871970/extras/2906a73169926f594fb2d403cd06d460.mp4?t=1711157148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You must be prepared to fend off anything that comes your way, with or without company. You will need to fix machinery, solve puzzles and power generators to unlock clues for the investigation of the recent disappearances. Do not explore alone, as many have already gone missing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871970/extras/bd5335b26b7f47141befba0c03d8b887.poster.avif?t=1711157148\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871970/extras/bd5335b26b7f47141befba0c03d8b887.webm?t=1711157148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871970/extras/bd5335b26b7f47141befba0c03d8b887.mp4?t=1711157148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "As a sewer maintenance worker for a prestigious company, your mission is to explore, solve puzzles and battle your way through a horrifying network of tunnels to uncover clues about workers that have mysteriously vanished.",
